    {
      "id": "claim_a7e7158c4c8a45fb80f615270eff2c3f",
      "statement": "Isolate admission and placement are decision-core policy: admit(load, shedding) refuses placement with Refusal when the pool is at ceiling, place() and place_cell() choose placement, and PoolLimits carry per-worker and per-cell capacities.",
