    {
      "id": "claim_b233ce8726b74e9d80b697a2f3e1a7ce",
      "statement": "The jemalloc stats features are required by the pressure classifier: tikv-jemalloc-ctl and tikv-jemallocator with the stats feature make stats.allocated and stats.resident readable so the difference yields the pages jemalloc keeps but no cell uses (allocator slack); without it a node that shed its whole working set stays latched on an RSS number the allocator controls.",
      "evidence": [
