    {
      "id": "claim_3ac2db5a5904447dacdb4de040c673fd",
      "statement": "Admission and pipeline knobs are documented with defaults: CELLD_MAX_LOADED_WORKERS (256), CELLD_MAX_CELL_REQUESTS (64), CELLD_MAX_RESIDENT_CELLS (hard limit at admission), CELLD_ACTIVATIONS (concurrent cold-cell activations, default min(CPU count, 128)), CELLD_LOG_CAPTURE_WORKERS (8), and CELLD_LOG_PIPELINE (4 fleet-log rounds in flight).",
