      "id": "claim_975ed3b69b8f465d9ecee688d18c734a",
      "statement": "CELLD_LOG_HEDGE_MS tunes the fleet-log hedge: the default is adaptive — four times the slowest recent append, at least 250 ms and always below the eviction backstop — and a fixed value or 0 (disabling the second copy) may be set, with appends idempotent per sequence so retransmission is safe.",
